### G.3 Cross-cover (no single point of failure)

| Primary | First cover | Second cover | What the cover must be able to do unaided |
|---|---|---|---|
| S1 (Cisco) | S4 | S3 | Log in to a device, run any allow-listed `show`, restore a config from the archive |
