| S3 (Linux) | S4 | S1 | Rebuild a Linux guest; re-apply nftables; verify the VIP failover |
| S4 (AI/docs) | S1 | S2 | Start the model server; start the MCP bundle; run one evaluation scenario and read the audit log |

**Cross-cover rule:** every owner writes a runbook for their own layer **by the end of week 8**, and every other member *executes* that runbook once, in week 10, as a verification exercise. The exercise record is itself a deliverable — it is the easiest way to satisfy the WSOS Domain 2 teamwork lines with evidence.

